{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05083","headline":"人日重宴大明宫赐彩缕人胜应制 · 沈佺期","name":"人日重宴大明宫赐彩缕人胜应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂旦鸡鸣仙衞陈，凭高龙首帝城春。\n千官黼帐杯前寿，百福香匳胜里人。\n山鸟初来犹怯啭，林花未发已偷新。\n天文正应韶光转，设报悬知用此辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}